# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Salvazion App — environment template (single source of truth)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy to .env.local and fill real values:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# .env.local is gitignored. Never commit secrets.
# Production: set the same keys in Vercel → Environment Variables.
#
# Domains:
#   App (this project):     https://app.salvazion.org
#   Marketing (Canva only): https://www.salvazion.org
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── App ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.salvazion.org
# CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=https://app.salvazion.org

# ─── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project Settings → API
# Project ref (docs): kppylfrsclkdmtpobpxd
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://kppylfrsclkdmtpobpxd.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# service_role secret — server only (Stripe webhook → public.subscriptions)
# Never use NEXT_PUBLIC_ for this key.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# Optional: SQL scripts from CLI (npm run db:phalanx)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.PROJECT:PASSWORD@aws-0-REGION.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=

# ─── Auth (X / Google) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Configure providers inside Supabase Auth. Optional override:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_X_AUTH_PROVIDER=twitter

# ─── Grok / xAI (server only) ─────────────────────────────────
# https://console.x.ai
# XAI_API_KEY=
# XAI_MODEL=grok-4.5
# XAI_BASE_URL=https://api.x.ai/v1
# XAI_TTS_VOICE=ara

# ─── Solana / $SALVAZION ──────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_NETWORK=mainnet-beta
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SALVAZION_MINT=7EiMiAx4ZMCDBqm3XiLiVHZccfuUYzu2xpDjsVJpV6D2

# ─── Jupiter Mobile (WalletConnect / Reown) ───────────────────
# https://dashboard.reown.com/
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=

# ─── Stripe Premium (Salvazion, Inc.) ─────────────────────────
# https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Webhook: https://app.salvazion.org/api/billing/webhook
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_... or rk_live_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# Defaults are baked in for Salvazion Premium product; override if needed:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID=prod_UxwcMVMNlKeczI
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_MONTHLY=price_1Ty0iyHOw5ZkjRlZMsCZPQWY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_ANNUAL=price_1Ty0iyHOw5ZkjRlZQBQYbfQ7

# ─── Wearables OAuth (Phase D / Premium) ──────────────────────
# Redirect URI each provider must match:
#   {NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/wearables/oauth/{provider}/callback
# WEARABLES_TOKEN_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string
# FITBIT_CLIENT_ID=
# FITBIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OURA_CLIENT_ID=
# OURA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_ID=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GARMIN_CLIENT_ID=
# GARMIN_CLIENT_SECRET=
